# Design & motion skills (project)

Before UI, motion, mobile-feel, or Apple-style design work, load the matching skill from `.agents/skills/` (mirrored in `.cursor/skills/`):

| Need | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Apple HIG audit / Liquid Glass / accessibility / platform conventions | `apple-hig` ([dickwu/apple-design-skill](https://github.com/dickwu/apple-design-skill)) |
| Apple fluid interfaces / springs / gesture motion on the web | `apple-design` ([emilkowalski/skills](https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills)) |
| General UI polish & taste | `emil-design-eng` |
| Build a new animation | `animate` |
| Review / improve / find / remove motion | `review-animations`, `improve-animations`, `find-animation-opportunities`, `remove-animations` |
| Phone web feel (safe areas, tap, hover) | `mobile-native` |

Motion tokens live in `src/app/globals.css` (`--ease-out`, `--ease-in-out`, `--ease-drawer`, `--duration-*`). Prefer those over inventing curves. UI transitions stay under ~300ms; entrances use strong ease-out; never ease-in for UI. Button presses: scale ~0.97 in 100–160ms. Glass stays on chrome (nav, bars), not stacked on content cards.
